            "title": "Can Silver X Mining (TSXV:AGX) Turn Cost Cuts Amid Lower Output Into a Durable Advantage?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Silver X Mining Corp. recently reported its third-quarter and nine-month 2025 results, showing lower ore mined and silver-equivalent production alongside slightly softer sales compared with the prior year. Despite these volume declines, the company cut its quarterly net loss to just over US$0.33 million and reduced its nine-month net loss to about US$0.74 million, pointing to meaningful cost improvements. Next, we\u2019ll examine how this sharp reduction in net losses shapes Silver X Mining\u2019s...",
